# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Public-repo exclusions.
#
# github.com/AviBenmayor/abenmayor is PUBLIC. The exercise brief allows describing
# the approach, not the data: "Do not share the files or post them anywhere. You are
# welcome to describe your approach, not the data, in a portfolio."
#
# So the deliverables and the analysis stay local. The analysis scripts are excluded
# too -- not because code is sensitive, but because these particular scripts carry the
# client's findings in their comments and print statements, which is the same data in
# prose form. What ships publicly is the README and the engineering that stands alone.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
